    "id": "art_triad-moving-the-least",
    "slug": "triad-moving-the-least",
    "title": "Move as Little as Possible",
    "summary": "C, F and G played on strings 1-2-3 by taking the nearest inversion each time — a whole progression that never leaves fret 0 through fret 5.",
    "tags": ["triads", "chords", "fretboard"],
    "readingTimeMin": 3,
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-14"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Play C, F and G as barre chords and you cross the whole neck doing it — C up at fret 8, F down at fret 1, G at fret 3. Every chord change is a jump, and every jump is a chance to land late."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There's a smaller way through the same three chords — three chords in C major, no barre required. Instead of one fixed shape per chord, take whichever inversion of the next chord is nearest to where your hand already is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        { "text": "Start on C, second inversion: " },
        { "text": "x x x 0 1 0", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " — " },
        { "text": "G3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "C4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "E4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        { "text": "Move to F, first inversion: " },
        { "text": "x x x 2 1 1", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " — " },
        { "text": "A3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "C4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "F4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "live",
      "component": "triad-shape",
      "props": {
        "root": "F",
        "strings": "1-2-3",
        "inversion": "first",
        "caption": "F major, first inversion, strings 1-2-3 — the same three strings, a fret or two from where C just was."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        { "text": "Then G, first inversion: " },
        { "text": "x x x 4 3 3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " — " },
        { "text": "B3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "D4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "G4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "live",
      "component": "triad-shape",
      "props": {
        "root": "G",
        "strings": "1-2-3",
        "inversion": "first",
        "caption": "G major, first inversion, strings 1-2-3 — the whole shape two frets up from F."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        { "text": "Then back to C, root position: " },
        { "text": "x x x 5 5 3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " — " },
        { "text": "C4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "E4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", " },
        { "text": "G4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Track the movement one string at a time and something stays put on every change:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        [{ "text": "Change" }],
        [{ "text": "String 3" }],
        [{ "text": "String 2" }],
        [{ "text": "String 1" }],
        [{ "text": "What happens" }]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [{ "text": "C → F" }],
          [{ "text": "+2", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "0", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "+1", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "C4 stays put on string 2" }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "F → G" }],
          [{ "text": "+2", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "+2", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "+2", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "the shape slides unchanged" }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "G → C" }],
          [{ "text": "+1", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "+2", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "0", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "G4 stays put on string 1" }]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [{ "text": "The whole progression lives between fret 0 and fret 5." }]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        [{ "text": "Chord" }],
